{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obliterate tens of thousands of enemies who dared to challenge you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/extras/gameplay.gif?t=1757896707\" /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Custom loadout</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your class, equipment, upgrades and melees to discover each time new <strong>powerful synergies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry <strong>up to 7 weapons at once</strong> and improve them by eliminating <strong>ever stronger enemies</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade enemies attacks, face mini-bosses <strong>each with unique mechanics</strong> and win by defeating <strong>Archon of Red.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 minutes games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 difficulty levels, including One-Hit and Endless Survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect souls to unlock new power-ups and fragments to upgrade your weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unlockable equipment, 98 power-ups and 8 melee weapons to build your <strong>OP</strong> loadout.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714400?t=1757896707","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/782d297b8a04f0abb35aa2664a279d4093855194/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757896707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714400/96f079f71da326174874c31279ad7d98338d497f/capsu